"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a1de7a09c>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:299
msgid ""
"**OpenMV N6 ROMFS:** increased from 16MB to 24MB, with the romfs image moved"
