#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:341
msgid ""
"Updated Arduino Nicla Vision USB PID matching to recognize a new application"
" PID (0x055F) alongside the original (0x045F). (`91ce4007c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/91ce4007c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"원래의 PID(0x045F)와 함께 새로운 애플리케이션 PID(0x055F)를 인식하도록 Arduino Nicla Vision USB "
"PID 매칭을 업데이트했습니다. (\\ `91ce4007c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/91ce4007c>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.7.0.rst:344
